" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260708/zhanbao_image_1867448_1783464928_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260708/zhanbao_image_1867448_1783464928_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>达文森·桑切斯、阿坎吉、库乔先后失点，瑞士点球大战淘汰哥伦比亚，1/4决赛将战阿根廷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d71b85ba2dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">决战！8强对阵：摩洛哥法国 西班牙比利时 挪威英格兰 阿根廷瑞士</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080653226670.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080653226670.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080653226670.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/8决赛全部结束，八强球队出炉。</p><p><strong>【世界杯纪录/数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4c594e2b679native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">双王加冕！梅西9助并列世界杯历史助攻王，21球独享历史射手王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4294548c9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4294548c9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4294548c9.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷让二追三3-2埃及，梅西世界杯生涯第9次助攻，并列成为世界杯历史助攻王。至此，梅西同时坐拥世界杯历史射手王与助攻王两项殊荣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d09f346129native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">上届夺冠！阿根廷连续两届世界杯晋级8强，将战瑞士</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4b0048212e1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4b0048212e1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4b0048212e1.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷淘汰埃及，连续2届世界杯晋级8强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d3ee166267native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">自我救赎！梅西失点后5分钟传射建功，让二追三带队晋级8强！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷3-2逆转埃及，本场梅西在第21分钟罚丢点球，随后传射带领阿根廷让二追三闯进8强！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d186858ccfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">刷爆！39岁梅西再刷N项纪录：包揽射手+助攻双王、连续6届助攻...</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d42e46d66f.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷3-2让二追三逆转埃及。39岁梅西本场1射1传，再次刷新N项纪录！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d40b7416b0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西独占榜首！本届世界杯最新射手榜：梅西8球，姆巴佩哈兰德7球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080209343759.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080209343759.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080209343759.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷3-2逆转淘汰埃及，世界杯最新射手榜，梅西8球独占榜首。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d41291218bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传射建功带队逆转！官方：梅西当选阿根廷3-2埃及最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080337039422.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080337039422.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/202607080337039422.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷3-2逆转埃及，本场比赛梅西传射建功，赛后他也当选了国际足联官方评选的全场最佳球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-08/6a4d43bcc7fbdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法老最后一舞？34岁萨拉赫止步16强，两届7场3球2助最佳成绩16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duo